mike: go snippet (keeps channel pattern, very short):
```go
func StreamRetry(c Client, req Req) (<-chan Chunk, error) {
  out := make(chan Chunk)
  go func() {
    defer close(out)
    for i:=0;i<3;i++ {
      if err := c.Stream(req, func(ch Chunk){ out<-ch }); err == nil { return }
      if !IsRetryable(err) { return }
      time.Sleep(time.Second << i)
    }
  }()
  return out, nil
}
```
tasha: nit — callout that Stream may yield partial chunks before an error; advise idempotency tokens or client-side dedupe for downstream systems.
